WEBVTT

00:08:28.504 --> 00:08:30.756
This is an issue of civil infrastructure,

00:08:30.798 --> 00:08:35.594
and civil infrastructure
is meant to serve civil societies,

00:08:36.345 --> 00:08:38.389
which includes all of us.

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.307
It includes everyone.

00:08:41.016 --> 00:08:42.726
So how does one get involved?

00:08:43.686 --> 00:08:46.063
Number one, use your voice.

00:08:46.855 --> 00:08:49.692
We need to be investing in solutions.

00:08:49.692 --> 00:08:53.946
The World Resources Institute showed
that for every 1 dollar spent

00:08:53.946 --> 00:08:56.615
on flood protection
infrastructure in India,

00:08:56.615 --> 00:09:01.245
it resulted in 248 dollars
of avoided damages.